results/codex/v4_pipeline_audit/snapshot_fc75b36/reports/Beating GUI Owl at 2B fairly.md:166:**Seed 30 is now a development set.** It has scored at least six LFM3 configurations: base, v1, runtime-feedback, v2, v2+force_think and v3. Under pure noise, picking the best of five variants inflates the score by about **3–5 tasks**, computed here for σ = 2.2–3.6 pp. New seeds only partly cure this. **38 of the 116 templates produce identical instances regardless of seed** ([AW-Generalization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.07432)), so results on the 78 seed-varying templates must also be reported separately.
