The sign-flip results reproduce independently, including the exact enumeration check. The continuous interval is about −7.273 to +10.769 pp; the script’s grid reports −7.2 to +10.7 pp, which does not change the failed non-inferiority decision. All 34 counted v4/GUI-Owl successes end explicitly. The stopwatch case remains the only clear contradiction I’ve found between a counted success and the recorded actions/screens.
